SUMMARY:CoffeeTue- BV Stonehouse Cafe (26R) C/D Pace-- RSVP required
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide Leader: (volunteer t
 o lead!)\nRide Sweep: (volunteer to sweep!)\n\nCoffeeTue rides:\n• A rot
 ating start location\, not a school\n• A predetermined route\n• 25+/- 
 mile routes\n• 12 to 14 and 14 to 17 mph average pace\n• “short” s
 top for refreshment/coffee mid-route at [Stonehouse Cafe](https://stonehou
 secafe.net/)\n\nLike an All Class Ride\, CoffeeTue does not have a single 
 pace.\nAs Sweep\, Rick Zook will bike with any "D" ride cyclist.\nThe Coff
 eeTue rides are social rides\, but cyclists are not expected to stay in on
 e group. Cyclists may pedal at their own comfortable paces. A planned stop
  to regroup is recommended. Please be supportive of the other cyclists to 
 avoid anyone biking alone or being dropped off the back of the last group.
 \n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, and Ride Together**\n\nClick for [Ride with GPS](
 https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/bv-stonehouse-cafe-26r/)\n\nHelme
 ts are mandatory. No ear buds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (
 spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing aro
 und a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSV
 P below to join this ride.\n\nBeing on Meetup does not mean you are a club
  member. [Join here](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_i
 d=60&club_id=257148).\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club'
 s [Code of Conduct](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page
 _id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984) \,\n[Rules of the Road](https://la
 ncbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_i
 d=325159) \, and [Ride Waiver](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=
 454318)\nIn case of accident\, consult the [Ride Leader Guide](https://s3.
 amazonaws.com/ClubExpressClubFiles/257148/documents/Ride_Leader_Guide_2026
 _123357428.pdf?AWSAccessKeyId=AKIA6MYUE6DNNJ6ROIH3&Expires=1778249903&resp
 onse-content-disposition=inline%3B%20filename%3DRide_Leader_Guide_2026.pdf
 &Signature=pwxGJ6nqlu4w9Zj8Kj%2Fl9U5%2BBtQ%3D).
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3146942
 91/
