SUMMARY:Impromptu: LV Rapturous Ride (20F)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nMonday Evening Road Ride 
 starting from Landis Valley Farm Museum. Join me as we preview a TdRR ride
 .\n\nAnticipated Average Pace: 11-12 mph\n\nRide leader: Jon Hartung\nSwee
 p: Volunteer to sweep\n\nRoute:\n[https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue
 /lv-rapturous-ride-20f-2/](https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/lv-rap
 turous-ride-20f-2/)\n\nThe ride leader will ride at the advertised average
  speed. This is intended to be a group ride with a no-drop rule as the mai
 n goal. The ride leader will do his/her best to keep the group together wi
 th occasional regroupings and a sweeper may also be appointed at the start
 . Please do not join this ride if you are not willing to ride with the gro
 up. If you exceed the posted pace\, you will be riding by yourself and enc
 ouraged to join a faster group.\n\nIf maintaining a 11-12 mph average is b
 eyond your current ability level\, please consider joining a slower ride f
 irst.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and a basic
  repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminat
 e passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership a
 nd Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being on Meetup does not mean you 
 are a club member.\n\nJoin @ Lancasterbikeclub.net -Member Signup. Your RS
 VP is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct: Code of Condu
 ct Guidance if an incident occurs: Incident Actions
